# Next.js app pages

## New product route

```
app/[locale]/{slug}/
  layout.tsx      # generateMetadata via buildProductPageMetadata
  page.tsx
  privacy/page.tsx
  terms/page.tsx
```

Mirror `hush-gallery/` (full) or an unpublished landing. Config: `lib/productApps.ts`.

## Metadata

```typescript
import { buildProductPageMetadata } from '@/lib/productSeo';
import { getTranslations } from 'next-intl/server';

const t = await getTranslations({ locale, namespace: 'myApp' });
return buildProductPageMetadata({ locale, appPath: '/my-app', t, keywords: [...] });
```

Unpublished: `robots: { index: false, follow: true }` from the publish flag.

## Stores & schema

- `DownloadStoreFab` / `StoreDownloadBadges` with `t('download.*')` and `utmContent`
- `BreadcrumbsStructuredData` on every page
- `SoftwareApplicationStructuredData` on full product pages
- Android ID in `lib/appStructuredData.ts`

New routes → `app/sitemap.ts`. Legal always listed; main path when published.
